      "entry_id": "BIOME:betternether:crimson_glowing_woods",
      "title": "Crimson Glowing Woods",
      "summary": {
        "text": "Crimson Glowing Woods é um bioma do Nether registrado por BetterNether: New Dawn com o ID betternether:crimson_glowing_woods. O título é mantido exatamente como aparece no asset pt-BR do provider.",
        "sources": [
          {"type": "RUNTIME", "ref": "betternether:biome/betternether:crimson_glowing_woods"},
          {"type": "OFFICIAL_CODE", "ref": "https://github.com/Reijin2312/BetterNether-New-Dawn/blob/543127cab48b1ecb0017fee4222af25e0583e185/src/main/java/org/betterx/betternether/registry/NetherBiomes.java"},
          {"type": "OFFICIAL_CODE", "ref": "https://github.com/Reijin2312/BetterNether-New-Dawn/blob/543127cab48b1ecb0017fee4222af25e0583e185/src/main/resources/assets/betternether/lang/pt_br.json"}
        ]
      },
      "sections": {
        "worldgen": {
          "text": "`NetherBiomesProvider` faz bootstrap deste ID com a configuração `CrimsonGlowingWoods`, e `NetherBiomes.registerBiomeToggles()` o inclui no conjunto configurável. O pipeline comum o registra como bioma do Nether; detalhes quantitativos de geração permanecem fora da prosa.",
          "sources": [
            {"type": "OFFICIAL_CODE", "ref": "https://github.com/Reijin2312/BetterNether-New-Dawn/blob/543127cab48b1ecb0017fee4222af25e0583e185/src/main/java/org/betterx/datagen/betternether/worldgen/NetherBiomesProvider.java"},
